people when we were overseas. And it's not just them. It's not just organizations associated

00:33:11.120 --> 00:33:15.520
affiliated with the State Department. It's also organizations affiliated with the two major political

00:33:15.520 --> 00:33:20.560
parties, both the Democrats and the Republicans have overseas arms in which they, and I'm using

00:33:20.560 --> 00:33:26.640
air quotes here, they encourage democratic reforms overseas. Really what it is, it's

00:33:26.640 --> 00:33:34.160
propagandization of people overseas. I bumped into them in Kuwait and in Pakistan and all over the

00:33:34.160 --> 00:33:42.640
world. But the CIA is not in the business of overt regime change. They're not in the business of overt

00:33:42.640 --> 00:33:48.560
propagandization. Everything that the CIA does is covert. The rest of it is left to the State

00:33:48.560 --> 00:33:54.640
Department and USAID and the Broadcasting Board of Governors with the Voice of America,

00:33:55.600 --> 00:34:01.360
all the stuff that you see with your own eyes, all the stuff that happens in public

00:34:02.400 --> 00:34:09.840
is done outside the intelligence community. And the irony there is that the goal is the same

00:34:09.840 --> 00:34:16.720
as the covert operations being done from within the intelligence community. So if the CIA is

00:34:16.720 --> 00:34:21.040
running around the world trying to vary secretly and discreetly overthrow government, that doesn't

00:34:21.120 --> 00:34:26.160
necessarily mean that it's doing something any different from what the State Department is doing

00:34:26.160 --> 00:34:31.360
or USAID is doing when the goal is the same. It's to overthrow a foreign government.

00:34:32.000 --> 00:34:35.760
Yeah, one thing that Chris Hedges always says to us is that when you see like

00:34:36.320 --> 00:34:41.360
overt operations being done, you can guess that there's about as much resources

00:34:41.360 --> 00:34:45.920
or more being put into the covert operations behind that as well. But let's talk a little

00:34:46.240 --> 00:34:51.200
bit first about the overt tactics, because it seems like there's basically a list of tactics that

00:34:51.200 --> 00:34:56.480
just get used over and over again. Can you talk about what are some of the tactics that are

00:34:56.480 --> 00:35:01.600
used overtly to overthrow a government? I'd like to tell you something that I learned

00:35:01.600 --> 00:35:08.240
almost by accident. When I happened to be in Yemen, when I was still with the Senate Foreign

00:35:08.240 --> 00:35:12.400
Relations Committee staff, and I was talking to the defense attache, I had made an

00:35:12.400 --> 00:35:16.960
appointment to see him, and I didn't really only as a courtesy, I didn't expect to

00:35:16.960 --> 00:35:22.000
to gather any information from the defense attache that I could use in my own report.

00:35:22.000 --> 00:35:28.800
But lo and behold, I did. I asked him, so how are things going here in Yemen? It seems to me

00:35:28.800 --> 00:35:33.680
like you can't really have much in the way of work when you don't have a viable government

00:35:33.680 --> 00:35:40.800
with which to deal. And he shocked me by saying that what he was doing was essentially

00:35:40.800 --> 00:35:47.440
propaganda work and what he called psiops or psychological operations. The military is very

00:35:47.440 --> 00:35:52.400
big on psychological operations. I always thought it was kind of a joke because it never works,

00:35:52.400 --> 00:35:56.800
but they're very proud of what they do. And I said, what kind of psiops are you are you

00:35:56.800 --> 00:36:04.160
managing here in Yemen? And he said, well, have you ever listened to NPR on Sunday mornings?

00:36:04.160 --> 00:36:08.640
They have this show called Wait, Wait, Don't Tell Me. And I said, sure, everybody knows

00:36:08.640 --> 00:36:14.320
Wait, Wait, Don't Tell Me. And he said, well, we're doing it in Arabic, and we're broadcasting it here

00:36:14.320 --> 00:36:21.600
in Yemen for young people. I said, okay, well, what's that supposed to do? Well, you know, it's

00:36:21.600 --> 00:36:28.480
part comedy, and it's part politics, and it's part current events, and we can plant subliminal

00:36:28.480 --> 00:36:36.720
messages in the jokes to make a Yemeni young people like the United States. I said, well,

00:36:36.720 --> 00:36:41.360
how's that working out for you? Because it seems like people are more worried about finding food

00:36:41.360 --> 00:36:48.880
and water so that their children don't starve to death than tuning into an NPR like Wait, Wait,

00:36:48.880 --> 00:36:55.360
Don't Tell Me kind of show to be propagandized by the Defense Department. And he said, well,

00:36:55.360 --> 00:36:59.040
you know, we're in the early stages, but this is something that's really good. This is something

00:36:59.040 --> 00:37:04.160
that's going to go somewhere. And I remember laughing and thinking, you know, you're a

00:37:04.160 --> 00:37:11.120
full bird colonel, and you believe this nonsense? But they do. And, and that's just one very small

00:37:11.120 --> 00:37:19.440
example of an overt way to either influence the government or to encourage the overthrow of a

00:37:19.440 --> 00:37:26.480
government. It's, it's ridiculous. It's sad at the same time. Yeah, well, psyops is definitely

00:37:26.480 --> 00:37:31.680
part of the process. What would be looking at the covert activities? Is there kind of a menu,

00:37:31.760 --> 00:37:36.960
a strategy and tactics menu? What's the typical approach that the CIA takes to overthrow?

00:37:37.840 --> 00:37:43.360
Yeah, well, you know, an overthrow is coming, or at least an attempted overthrow is coming

00:37:43.360 --> 00:37:49.280
when the CIA creates something internally called a fusion center. We never had these fusion

00:37:49.280 --> 00:37:55.440
centers when I first started there. But then they began popping up to cover issues like Iraq

00:37:55.440 --> 00:38:03.120
and Iran, for example. What they do is, is they'll take representatives from the directorate of

00:38:03.120 --> 00:38:09.600
intelligence, which is the analytic arm of the CIA, the directorate of operations, which is the spies

00:38:09.600 --> 00:38:14.640
of the CIA, the directorate of science and technology, they're the guys who make the

00:38:14.640 --> 00:38:20.480
gadgets in the gizmos. But then they'll also have people from NSA doing the intercepts or

00:38:20.480 --> 00:38:29.680
from DARPA doing the very forward thinking, highly classified gadgets that haven't fully

00:38:29.680 --> 00:38:35.440
been developed yet, but are in the process, like, like laser beams, for example, this is

00:38:35.440 --> 00:38:39.920
something that's come out in public, laser beams that can be fired at enemy troops,

00:38:39.920 --> 00:38:44.880
so that instead of killing them, you blind them. The irony there is that

00:38:45.840 --> 00:38:50.080
it's legal according to international law to kill them on the battlefield,

00:38:50.800 --> 00:38:56.000
but it's a crime against humanity to blind them with the laser. So that's actually illegal.

00:38:56.000 --> 00:39:00.720
But you bring all of these people together, all with different backgrounds and with different

00:39:00.720 --> 00:39:07.040
agendas and different specializations, and you give them an office that's tightly controlled,

00:39:07.040 --> 00:39:12.720
you need special clearance to get in the office, and all together, they plot these

00:39:12.800 --> 00:39:18.960
overthrows. Now, the normal business of the CIA is the analyst sits in a cubicle and thinks the

00:39:18.960 --> 00:39:23.120
big thoughts and writes papers for the White House, or you write the president's daily brief.

00:39:23.760 --> 00:39:30.240
The operational people plan the targeting of individuals for recruitment. You remember that

00:39:30.240 --> 00:39:37.680
the basic purpose of there being a CIA is to recruit spies to steal secrets. And that's all

00:39:37.680 --> 00:39:43.520
very quaint. But when it comes to overthrowing a government, it's that fusion center you should

00:39:43.520 --> 00:39:48.400
be worried about. Because when that thing is created, or as they say in the intelligence

00:39:48.400 --> 00:39:54.960
community stood up, something bad is going to happen. So it sounds like groups like the

00:39:54.960 --> 00:39:59.920
military doing psyops, USAID, infiltrating, or

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:03.520
or creating organizations within countries, nonprofits,

00:40:03.520 --> 00:40:07.680
or having their own media within countries to do propaganda,

00:40:07.680 --> 00:40:11.160
all of that is kind of the overt side of it.

00:40:11.160 --> 00:40:13.720
And so on the covert side,

00:40:13.720 --> 00:40:16.480
is it mostly just intelligence gathering then

00:40:16.480 --> 00:40:20.860
or do they actually do operations in these countries,

00:40:20.860 --> 00:40:24.120
infiltration or things like that to help them out?

00:40:24.120 --> 00:40:27.920
The answer is yes, and yes, and yes.

00:40:27.960 --> 00:40:30.440
So they're doing all of these different things.

00:40:30.440 --> 00:40:32.400
So there are people at different levels

00:40:32.400 --> 00:40:35.280
whose jobs are different in that.

00:40:35.280 --> 00:40:38.760
Perhaps you have some case officers or operations officers,

00:40:38.760 --> 00:40:41.120
they're also called on the ground whose job it is

00:40:41.120 --> 00:40:43.920
to recruit these spies to steal secrets,

00:40:43.920 --> 00:40:47.920
to recruit spies to infiltrate the government

00:40:47.920 --> 00:40:49.120
that you're trying to overthrow

00:40:49.120 --> 00:40:52.320
so that you get an idea of that government's

00:40:52.320 --> 00:40:54.200
plans and intentions.

00:40:54.200 --> 00:40:57.060
Then at the same time you have operations officers

00:40:57.060 --> 00:41:00.180
who are planning what are called active measures

00:41:00.180 --> 00:41:01.300
against that government.

00:41:01.300 --> 00:41:05.020
And that is a propagandization,

00:41:05.020 --> 00:41:09.700
maybe you try to hijack a radio station or a TV station,

00:41:09.700 --> 00:41:12.780
you plant propaganda in the media,

00:41:12.780 --> 00:41:15.580
you've got guys who are trying to recruit journalists

00:41:15.580 --> 00:41:19.380
so you can put US propaganda in the op-ed pages

00:41:19.380 --> 00:41:23.520
or in articles about domestic politics.

00:41:23.520 --> 00:41:26.700
You have NSA intercepting the communications

00:41:26.700 --> 00:41:29.020
of the leaders of that government.

00:41:29.020 --> 00:41:32.240
You've got the military doing active measures

00:41:32.240 --> 00:41:35.660
from the US embassy like, wait, wait, don't tell me.

00:41:35.660 --> 00:41:38.220
So everybody has a different job,

00:41:38.220 --> 00:41:41.060
but every one of those jobs in the end

00:41:41.060 --> 00:41:44.060
is supposed to lead to the overthrow of that government.

00:41:44.060 --> 00:41:46.620
It's so interesting you talk about the CIA

00:41:46.620 --> 00:41:47.740
taking over media.

00:41:47.740 --> 00:41:50.420
There've been lots of reports of the CIA

00:41:50.420 --> 00:41:52.540
involvement with US media,

00:41:52.540 --> 00:41:55.380
having people in the media or owning journalists.

00:41:55.380 --> 00:41:57.340
So part of this regime change operations

00:41:57.340 --> 00:41:59.300
is also to affect US public

00:41:59.300 --> 00:42:00.860
and our thinking about what's going on.

00:42:00.860 --> 00:42:02.980
There's so much misinformation on Venezuela,

00:42:02.980 --> 00:42:04.300
Iran and other countries.

00:42:04.300 --> 00:42:07.740
What's the relationship with the CIA and US journalism?

00:42:07.740 --> 00:42:11.220
That is a good and very important question.

00:42:11.220 --> 00:42:15.140
After Operation Mockingbird was exposed

00:42:15.140 --> 00:42:18.780
where the CIA was recruiting American journalists

00:42:18.780 --> 00:42:21.340
and planting stories in the US media

00:42:21.340 --> 00:42:23.580
to propagandize the American people,

00:42:23.620 --> 00:42:25.700
Congress took action

00:42:25.700 --> 00:42:28.740
and they specifically made that illegal.

00:42:28.740 --> 00:42:30.620
Well, the CIA has been able to get around that

00:42:30.620 --> 00:42:32.140
over the years.

00:42:32.140 --> 00:42:36.000
And so while you can't recruit an American journalist,

00:42:36.000 --> 00:42:39.500
you certainly can and in many cases

00:42:39.500 --> 00:42:41.420
do recruit foreign journalists.

00:42:41.420 --> 00:42:43.980
At the same time, at the beginning

00:42:43.980 --> 00:42:46.300
of the Obama administration,

00:42:46.300 --> 00:42:48.580
there was an incident that almost nobody paid

00:42:48.580 --> 00:42:52.580
any attention to that had very far-reaching consequences.

00:42:52.580 --> 00:42:56.260
And that was that radio and TV Marti,

00:42:56.260 --> 00:42:59.100
which is the propaganda arm

00:42:59.100 --> 00:43:01.260
of the Broadcasting Board of Governors

00:43:01.260 --> 00:43:03.580
that's targeted against Cuba,

00:43:03.580 --> 00:43:06.860
was picked up by Direct TV,

00:43:06.860 --> 00:43:11.860
which is the satellite television provider, right?

00:43:11.860 --> 00:43:13.660
Direct TV's all over America.

00:43:13.660 --> 00:43:16.620
Well, you can't have TV Marti

00:43:16.620 --> 00:43:19.380
on Direct TV for Americans to watch.

00:43:19.380 --> 00:43:21.220
And so a court said,

00:43:21.220 --> 00:43:24.060
hey, you know, if that's illegal, you can't do that.

00:43:24.060 --> 00:43:26.300
Well, the administration appealed

00:43:26.300 --> 00:43:28.740
and what ended up happening

00:43:28.740 --> 00:43:32.100
was that only Direct TV in Florida

00:43:32.100 --> 00:43:34.980
was allowed to carry TV Marti

00:43:34.980 --> 00:43:37.660
because their position was

00:43:37.660 --> 00:43:40.100
that they were really directing this

00:43:40.100 --> 00:43:42.580
at Cuba and Cuban nationals.

00:43:43.420 --> 00:43:48.580
Well, even though something like 14 million Floridians

00:43:48.620 --> 00:43:51.260
then had access to TV Marti,

00:43:51.260 --> 00:43:54.860
the court ruled that, well, sure,

00:43:54.860 --> 00:43:58.300
but Americans can recognize propaganda.

00:43:58.300 --> 00:44:00.980
What's more important is that

00:44:00.980 --> 00:44:04.900
the people of Cuba be exposed to this propaganda.

00:44:04.900 --> 00:44:07.460
But what ended up happening was,

00:44:07.460 --> 00:44:10.140
de facto, it made it legal then

00:44:10.140 --> 00:44:12.740
to propagandize the American people

00:44:12.740 --> 00:44:16.420
that had never been legal before in this country.

00:44:16.420 --> 00:44:17.740
To make matters worse,

00:44:17.740 --> 00:44:21.020
we know through Buzzfeed

00:44:21.020 --> 00:44:24.300
and specifically through the journalist, Jason Leopold,

00:44:24.300 --> 00:44:26.260
who I think is one of the great

00:44:26.260 --> 00:44:28.940
young journalists working today,

00:44:28.940 --> 00:44:32.060
Jason is the king of the Freedom of Information Act

00:44:32.060 --> 00:44:35.580
and indeed a former Defense Department official

00:44:35.580 --> 00:44:37.660
called him a foyer terrorist

00:44:37.660 --> 00:44:39.940
because he uses the Freedom of Information Act

00:44:39.940 --> 00:44:41.980
against the government.

00:44:41.980 --> 00:44:45.740
Jason made a Freedom of Information Act request

00:44:45.740 --> 00:44:50.140
of the CIA in which he asked for every email

00:44:50.140 --> 00:44:52.660
over the previous two years

00:44:52.660 --> 00:44:56.460
between an American journalist

00:44:56.460 --> 00:44:58.860
and the CIA's Office of Public Affairs.

00:44:58.860 --> 00:45:01.820
Now, in a normal situation,

00:45:01.820 --> 00:45:05.380
that would be a waste of time and paper.

00:45:05.380 --> 00:45:07.260
But what he ended up getting

00:45:07.260 --> 00:45:11.380
was hundreds and hundreds of email conversations

00:45:11.380 --> 00:45:14.580
between CIA and American journalists

00:45:14.620 --> 00:45:16.780
that were controversial to the point

00:45:16.780 --> 00:45:21.780
where Ken Delanian, formerly of the Los Angeles Times,

00:45:22.580 --> 00:45:26.820
now of MSNBC, was writing articles

00:45:26.820 --> 00:45:30.700
based on information leaked to him by the CIA

00:45:30.700 --> 00:45:34.740
and then he was sending the articles back to the CIA

00:45:34.740 --> 00:45:39.420
for clearance before he sent them to his own editor.

00:45:40.540 --> 00:45:42.380
So what that is means.

00:45:42.380 --> 00:45:47.380
Yeah, that's CIA propagandization of the American people.

00:45:47.700 --> 00:45:51.180
And you know, it was a big story for a day

00:45:51.180 --> 00:45:54.020
and then it went away and nobody really cared.

00:45:54.020 --> 00:45:55.940
And Ken Delanian is still

00:45:55.940 --> 00:45:59.500
the Chief Intelligence Correspondent at MSNBC.

00:46:00.660 --> 00:46:01.940
That's amazing.

00:46:01.940 --> 00:46:03.620
Well, it sure does seem like the US media

00:46:03.620 --> 00:46:07.860
has a lot of propaganda from CIA, Pentagon.

00:46:07.860 --> 00:46:09.660
Oh, just looking at the Washington Post.

00:46:09.660 --> 00:46:10.500
Oh my gosh.

00:46:10.500 --> 00:46:12.460
It's certainly the article on Venezuela.

00:46:12.460 --> 00:46:13.300
Terrible stuff.

00:46:13.300 --> 00:46:16.020
Yeah, the amount of lies and how it just puts forward

00:46:16.020 --> 00:46:18.300
the imperialist viewpoint. Totally.

00:46:18.300 --> 00:46:20.740
It's like, do you do journalism anymore?

00:46:20.740 --> 00:46:22.100
We see it all the time in Reuters

00:46:22.100 --> 00:46:23.820
and all kinds of things where I have to ask them.

00:46:23.820 --> 00:46:26.100
I'm like, did you actually investigate this?

00:46:27.660 --> 00:46:30.060
You know, there's a lot going on around the world right now

00:46:30.060 --> 00:46:32.620
and people don't always see it through it.

00:46:32.620 --> 00:46:35.100
I mean, even people on the left of the United States

00:46:35.100 --> 00:46:38.980
were fooled by the coup attempt in Nicaragua in 2018

00:46:38.980 --> 00:46:41.700
by the protests going on in Hong Kong

00:46:41.700 --> 00:46:44.620
and now the situation in Belarus.

00:46:44.620 --> 00:46:48.700
When you see something happening around the world

00:46:48.700 --> 00:46:50.980
like what we're seeing in Hong Kong and Belarus,

00:46:50.980 --> 00:46:52.140
what are your first thoughts?

00:46:52.140 --> 00:46:55.940
How do you figure out what this is all about?

00:46:55.940 --> 00:46:58.020
Oh, I think you have to assume

00:46:58.020 --> 00:47:01.780
that the CIA is involved in these things, not always.

00:47:01.780 --> 00:47:04.380
Like when something happens very quickly,

00:47:04.380 --> 00:47:06.420
there's an uprising, you know,

00:47:06.420 --> 00:47:08.580
there's a bread riot, let's say.

00:47:08.620 --> 00:47:11.260
I don't automatically assume, for example,

00:47:11.260 --> 00:47:14.060
that the CIA is involved in Egyptian bread riots.

00:47:14.060 --> 00:47:15.300
There's no reason for them to be,

00:47:15.300 --> 00:47:16.700
there's no end game for them.

00:47:16.700 --> 00:47:18.220
But if you look at Belarus,

00:47:18.220 --> 00:47:22.540
or I think even more appropriately, you look at Hong Kong,

00:47:22.540 --> 00:47:25.220
yeah, I would bet a paycheck

00:47:25.220 --> 00:47:27.540
that the CIA has some sort of involvement,

00:47:27.540 --> 00:47:31.580
whether it's providing money or logistics

00:47:31.580 --> 00:47:36.580
or radio support or planting stories in the media,

00:47:37.580 --> 00:47:41.100
sure, because if there's chaos in Belarus,

00:47:41.100 --> 00:47:42.700
that benefits the United States.

00:47:42.700 --> 00:47:44.900
If there's chaos in Hong Kong

00:47:44.900 --> 00:47:47.420
that in turn is weakening the Chinese government

00:47:47.420 --> 00:47:49.980
or causing a threat of some sort to the Chinese government,

00:47:49.980 --> 00:47:51.780
that benefits the United States.

00:47:51.780 --> 00:47:53.100
So where you see things

00:47:53.100 --> 00:47:55.660
that have been bubbling along for a while

00:47:55.660 --> 00:47:58.540
and then end up in the streets,

00:47:58.540 --> 00:48:02.740
definitely the CIA is involved in one way or another.

00:48:02.740 --> 00:48:04.500
Now, in most of those cases,

00:48:04.660 --> 00:48:06.540
we're never gonna really know what the truth is

00:48:06.540 --> 00:48:09.580
because the information is classified

00:48:09.580 --> 00:48:11.180
and mandatory declassification

00:48:11.180 --> 00:48:13.540
doesn't happen for another 30 years.

00:48:13.540 --> 00:48:15.580
So unless there's a leak

00:48:15.580 --> 00:48:17.060
or unless something is released

00:48:17.060 --> 00:48:18.740
in a Freedom of Information Act request

00:48:18.740 --> 00:48:20.940
that otherwise shouldn't be released,

00:48:20.940 --> 00:48:22.100
we can only speculate.

00:48:22.100 --> 00:48:24.540
We really aren't gonna know for certain.

00:48:24.540 --> 00:48:26.540
So like, for instance, in Hong Kong

00:48:26.540 --> 00:48:29.100
where there was a group of the protesters,

00:48:29.100 --> 00:48:32.220
the ones that were really being overtly racist

00:48:32.260 --> 00:48:36.220
towards China and calling for recolonization by the UK

00:48:36.220 --> 00:48:37.420
or Trump comes save us,

00:48:37.420 --> 00:48:39.380
they also were very well equipped

00:48:39.380 --> 00:48:41.140
and they seemed very sophisticated.

00:48:41.140 --> 00:48:43.300
They were doing a lot of property damage

00:48:43.300 --> 00:48:45.140
and they all had the same equipment,

00:48:45.140 --> 00:48:47.580
the same gas masks

00:48:47.580 --> 00:48:50.700
and then they're matching umbrellas.

00:48:50.700 --> 00:48:53.380
Is it possible then that that equipment

00:48:53.380 --> 00:48:56.780
and training to do that came from the United States?

00:48:56.780 --> 00:48:59.020
Yes, and I'll give you another example

00:48:59.020 --> 00:49:00.380
and this is something that I know

00:49:00.380 --> 00:49:02.820
from my own firsthand experience.

00:49:04.180 --> 00:49:08.940
Do you remember immediately upon the liberation of Kuwait

00:49:08.940 --> 00:49:13.940
from Iraqi occupation in February of 1991?

00:49:14.140 --> 00:49:17.100
I'm sure if you think back on the news broadcast

00:49:17.100 --> 00:49:19.100
that you saw at the time,

00:49:19.100 --> 00:49:22.740
practically every Kuwaiti citizen lined the streets

00:49:22.740 --> 00:49:23.900
in the center of the city,

